                "title": "3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners, Heavy Duty Solid Brass Hinge, Pair, Deltana DSB35",
                "description": "Deltana DSB35 - 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 Hinges, Solid Brass with square corners. Heavy Duty 0.119 thick. Package includes a pair of hinges, matching solid brass flathead, Phillips screws and standard removable button tip finials. Available in 11 different finishes.",
